abstract: "An open observatory of energy modelling studies applied to African countries, the tools they use and the institutions that lead them. It started from a PRISMA 2020 systematic review (1,053 studies, 101 tools, 54 countries) and is kept up to date through community contributions, an automated literature search and curator review. Data exports are CC BY 4.0."
